    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Bend Doom and Darkness to Your Will</p></blockquote><p>Your innate magic comes from the most nebulous and inscrutable forces of the Shadowfell or of other realms of supernatural darkness. You might trace your lineage to an entity from such a place, or you were exposed to the sinister energy of a shadow dragon and transformed by it. Your shadowy magic lets you command darkness, undeath, and woe.</p><h3>Shadow Sorcery Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.RBi2Yjy6o8yYVs4n]{Shadow Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.ZXL6JhbfWun6bdyf]{Power of Shadow}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.7QhlhVeZPWB1LeG8]{Beasts of Ill Omen}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.TohEF48InsgcMf5V]{Shadow Walk}</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.reOyi6xw1XEqbAwQ]{Umbral Form}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Shadow Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Sorcerer Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBane000000]{Bane}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDarkness00]{Darkness}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplInflictWou]{Inflict Wounds}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplPasswithou]{Pass without Trace}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.azhfcdy96idtT6uT]{Hunger of Hadar}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplNondetecti]{Nondetection}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGreaterInv]{Greater Invisibility}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplPhantasmal]{Phantasmal Killer}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplContagion0]{Contagion}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCreation00]{Creation}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
